  <data name="OnboardingSingleTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Get started with PcMate</value></data>
  <data name="OnboardingSingleBody" xml:space="preserve"><value>Keep a companion on your desktop and see what your PC is doing at a glance.&#10;&#10;1. Drag the character to place it anywhere on your desktop.&#10;2. Left-click the character to say hello.&#10;3. Right-click the character to open the quick settings menu.&#10;4. Choose Memory, CPU, GPU, or Network and adjust its state thresholds.&#10;5. Register a custom character with one or more state images.&#10;6. Adjust the resource bar, speech bubble, text contrast, and animation speed from the menu.&#10;&#10;※ Network speed comes from Windows traffic counters. PcMate does not run a speed test or create extra network traffic.</value></data>
